{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">節目《美食新聞報道》繼續帶大家探索本港極具特色的精緻美食與人氣話題小店！今集主持人分別深入中環與尖沙咀，帶大家體驗驚喜十足的全港首創芝士 Omakase、充滿「家的味道」的無添加老火靚湯，以及邪惡指數爆燈的創意菠蘿包！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由莫燦霖師傅帶著波波（黃婧靈）開展全港首創的芝士主題 Omakase 尋味之旅。店家巧妙運用世界各地的優質芝士，搭配頂級日式食材，打造出兼具視覺與味覺驚喜的日式料理。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【ROUCOU】</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址</strong>：中環鴨巴甸街28號地舖</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4158fb7e-b25e-46a6-9636-dccc0695ccfc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026vgpneqexvq1791342438.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4158fb7e-b25e-46a6-9636-dccc0695ccfc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d64a4106-e723-4fb3-b892-1915abd3523f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026MjcvReLuNy1791342437.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d64a4106-e723-4fb3-b892-1915abd3523f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"27727a08-76c1-40bd-8248-fbf0b00ab44f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qOGfoRfuYs1791342437.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"27727a08-76c1-40bd-8248-fbf0b00ab44f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由黃嘉雯與廖慧儀來到尖沙咀一間溫馨小店，尋訪充滿「家的味道」的無添加老火靚湯與手工甜品。店內堅持天天更換湯款，且每日限定供應 3 款，確保新鮮與品質。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【湯糖堂】</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f8f595f6-7cf2-4810-ad40-72683954afb0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20262OmoSW8yWT1791342436.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8f595f6-7cf2-4810-ad40-72683954afb0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳若思與葉靖儀去到一間話題度極高的人氣包店，品嚐多款創意菠蘿包系列小食：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【The Forest Bakery Plus】</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e400edae-062d-4eed-8986-29fa98194400.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026wr0mh8Imte1791342439.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e400edae-062d-4eed-8986-29fa98194400.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dcb747fa-7447-4e2e-93ee-70d8c173509b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20261vDEwbm4dk1791342439.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dcb747fa-7447-4e2e-93ee-70d8c173509b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T13:59:21.600955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}